          "type": "heading",
          "text": "39. Mistakes: Keys & Deps"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Index key on a reorderable or filterable list.",
            "State and DOM then attach to the wrong items.",
            "Random keys: remount, lost focus, scroll, animation.",
            "Omitting a dep to 'stop the loop' gives stale closures."
          ]
        }
